(10k). Following method C with
4-(5-amino-2,4-difluorophenoxy)-3-nitropyridin-2-amine 9k (0.226 g, 0.8
mmol) and 10k was obtained as a pure yellow solid (0.33 g, 88%). 1H-NMR δ
: 6.09 (d, 1H, HPy,5, J = 6.0), 7.26 (s, 2H, NH2), 7.63 (d, 1H, Harom, J
= 8.0), 7.7 (m, 3H, Harom), 7.90 (s, 1H, Harom), 8.00 (d, 1H, Harom, J =
8.0), 8.06 (d, 1H, HPy,6, J = 6.0), 10.4 (s, 1H, CONH). 19F NMR δ :
-56.78 (s, 3F, CF3), -118.54 (m, 1F), -129.58 (m, 1F). LC-MS: m/z 471
(M+H, 100).
