$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure for the Synthesis of
Dinitrocarbamates 8 An amine (1 equiv) was added to the stirred mixture
of 7 (1 equiv) and 4-DMAP (1.5-2.5 equiv) in anhyd CH2Cl2. The mixture
was stirred at r.t. for 1-5 h, then washed with 5% HCl solution, H2O, and
dried (Na2SO4). Compound 8e, yield 87%.
