$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM d) Hydrogenolysis of 11 and subsequent acetylation of the resulting free
amino group. 10% Pd/C (75 mg) and ammonium formate (5.12 mmol, 323 mg)
were added to a solution of 11 (0.256 mmol, 102 mg) and anhydrous MeOH
(10 mL) under a nitrogen atmosphere. The mixture was stirred overnight at
room temperature, filtered through a pad of Celite and the pad was then
washed with MeOH (10 mL). The combined organic layers were concentrated
in vacuo, and the resulting solid residue was treated with aqueous 3 M
NaOH (10 mL) and extracted with AcOEt (3 × 10 mL). The combined new
organic layers were dried and concentrated in vacuo and the resulting
residue directly treated with acetyl chloride (0.341 mmol, 25 μL) and
triethylamine (0.341 mmol, 48 μL) in dry dichloromethane (5 mL) under a
nitrogen atmosphere. After stirring the mixture overnight at room
temperature, it was washed with water (2 × 5 mL), and the combined
aqueous layers were extracted with CH2Cl2 (3 × 10 mL). The combined
organic layers were dried and concentrated and the corresponding residue
was finally purified by flash column chromatography [eluents: (1)
hexane/AcOEt 1:3; (2) AcOEt/MeOH 25:1] to obtain (S)-linezolid [(S)-1]
(73 mg, 85% yield over the two steps).
(S)-5-(Acetamidomethyl)-3-(3-fluoro-4-morpholinophenyl)-1,3-oxazolidin-2-one
[(S)-linezolid, (S)-1]. White solid; m.p. 180.9-182.2 °C (lit.:2
181.5-182.5 °C). [α]D 20 = −(c 1.0, CHCl3) [lit.:2 −(c 0.919, CHCl3)]. ee
> 99.5%. IR (CH2Cl2): 3342, 1742, 1660 cm−1 1H NMR (400.13 MHz): 7.40
(dd, Hb, 3JHb,F = 14.3, 4JHb,Hf = 2.6 Hz), 7.08-7.00 (m, Hf), 6.89 (t,
He, 3JHe,Hf = 4JHe,F = 9.0 Hz), 6.66 [broad t, N(2')H, 3J = 5.6 H], 4.76
[m, C(5)H], 4.00 [t, C(4)HH, 2J = 3J = 9.0 Hz], 3.84 [m, (CH2)2O], 3.74
[dd, C(4)HH, 2J = 9.2, 3J = 6.7 Hz], 3.80-3.56 [m, (C1')H2], 3.02 [m,
(CH2)2N], 2.00 (s, CH3). 13C NMR (100.63 MHz): 171.3 (C-3'), 155.3 (d,
Cc, 1JC,F = 245 Hz), 154.4 (C-2), 136.4 (d, Cd, 2JC,F = 8.8 Hz), 132.8
(d, Ca, 3JC,F = 11.1 Hz), 118.7 (d, Ce, 3JC,F = 4.4 Hz), 113.9 (d, Cf,
4JC,F = 2.9 Hz), 107.4 (d, Cb, 2JC,F = 26.5 Hz), 71.9 (C-5), 66.8
[(CH2)2O], 50.8 [(CH2)2N], 47.5 (C-1'), 41.8 (C-4), 22.9 (CH3). EI-MS
(m/z , %): 337.1 (M+, 91), 293.1 (100), 234.1 (69), 209.1 (90). EI-HRMS
calcd. for C16H20FN3O4, 337.1438; found, 337.1438.
