$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Chemical synthesis of 2-Allyl 1-methyl
(±)-1,3-dihydro-2H-isoindole-1,2-dicarboxylate (10) A solution of
isoindoline methyl ester 6 (18 mg, 0.102 mmol, 1.0 equiv.), allyl
chloroformate (13 μL, 0.122 mmol, 1.2 equiv.) and distilled NEt3 (14 μL,
0.102 mmol, 1.0 equiv.) in dry CH2Cl2(1.0 mL) was stirred overnight at
room temperature and under nitrogen atmosphere. Then CH2Cl2(10 mL) was
added and the organic layer washed with water (2 x 10 mL), dried and
concentrated in vacuo. The racemic carbamate 10 (23 mg, 85%). Present as
two rotamers. Colorless oil. R f (50% EtOAc/hexane): 0.65. [α]20 D = +
88.8 (c 1.0, CHCl3). 94% ee. IR (NaCl): 1757, 1713 cm-1. 1H NMR (CDCl3,
300.13 MHz): 3.75, 3.79 (2 overlapped s, 3H, OCH3), 4.55-4.95 (m, 4H,
2H3+2H3’), 5.20-5.45 (m, 2H, 2H5’), 5.57, 5.59 (2 overlapped d, 4 J HH =
2.4 Hz, 4 J HH = 2.0 Hz,1H, H1), 5.97 (m, 1H, H4’), 7.22-7.50 (m, 4H,
H4+H5+H6+H7). 13C NMR (CDCl3, 75.48 MHz): 52.0, 52.4 (C3), 52.5, 52.6
(C1), 64.9, 65.2 (OCH3), 66.1, 66.2 (C3’), 117.2, 117.5 (C5’), 122.8,
122.9, 123.0, 123.0, 127.8, 128.7, 128.8, 132.5, 132.6 (C4+C5+C6+C7+C4’),
134.6, 134.9, 136.8, 137.2 (C3a+C7a), 154.1, 154.5 (NHCOO), 170.4, 170.7
(CO). MS (ESI+, m/z): 284.0 [(M+Na)+, 100%]. HRMS (ESI+, m/z): calcd for
C14H15NNaO4 +, (M+Na)+: 284.0893, found: 284.0900.
