$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (3-Hydroxy-1-methylpropyl)[4-(methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid Phenyl
Ester (32b). i-Pr2NEt (0.21 mL, 2.37 mmol) was added to a stirred and
cooled (-78 °C) solution of 32a (444 mg, 1.97 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (12 mL).
PhOCOCl (0.31 mL, 2.37 mmol) was then added at a fast dropwise rate, and
stirring was continued for 2 h (Ar atmosphere). The mixture was diluted
with CHCl3, washed with water and brine, dried (MgSO4) and evaporated.
Flash chromatography of the residue over silica, using 2:1 EtOAc-hexane,
gave 32b (566 mg) as a colorless oil:
(3-Hydroxy-1-methylpropyl)[4-(methoxymethoxy)phenyl]carbamic Acid Phenyl
Ester (32b), yield 83% FTIR (CH2Cl2 cast) 3467, 2934, 1716, 1594 cm-1; 1H
NMR (C6D6, 400 MHz) δ 0.88 (d, J = 6.7 Hz, 3 H), 1.43-1.55 (m, 1 H), 1.62
(br m, 1 H), 3.09 (s, 3 H), 3.19 (br s, 1 H), 3.61-3.71 (br m, 1 H),
3.71-3.81 (br m, 1 H), 4.79 (br s, 3 H), 6.86 (apparent tt, J = 7.3, 1.1
Hz, 1 H), 6.92-7.03 (m, 6 H), 7.05-7.10 (m, 2 H); 13C NMR (C6D6, 100 MHz)
δ 19.7 (q), 38.4 (t), 50.7 (d), 55.7 (q), 59.4 (t), 94.5 (t), 116.6 (d),
121.9 (d), 125.2 (d), 129.3 (d), 131.0 (d), 132.0 (s), 152.2 (s), 155.2
(s), 157.2 (s); exact mass m/z calcd for C19H23NO5 345.15762, found
345.15801.
